# Build directories
**/cmake-build-*/
**/build/
**/Debug/
**/Release/

# IDE files
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.vs/

# Compiled binaries
**/*.exe
**/*.dll
**/*.so
**/*.dylib
**/*.a
**/*.lib
**/*.pdb

# CMake generated files
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/cmake_install.cmake
**/Makefile
**/CMakeFiles/
**/*.cmake
!**/CMakeLists.txt

# Object files
**/*.o
**/*.obj

# Temporary files
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*.log

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

